                                "sense_id": "b924bf30-7866-326f-8b11-0f2322dcef12",
                                "text": "It was such a tubular party, Journal! But a few minutes later, I walked up to the Hermosa Beach Pier and left the girls with my things, thinking the totally bitchin' party would continue. But when I got back, they were all gone."
                            }
                        ]
